 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Technique Extermination — Innate Technique (1st level)</em></p><blockquote><p>Your technique bestows its user with the gift of angelic power, capable of smiting villains and hampering enemy’s cursed techniques.</p></blockquote><p>Beginning at 1st level, you have gained use of the essentials of your technique. As an action for 2 cursed energy, you can target a creature you can see within 30 ft as a trumpet of light appears and a beam of light falls from the sky. The target must succeed a Charisma save, if the creature fails it takes 2d12 radiant damage and loses the ability to use Cursed Energy for 1 minute. On a success, they take half as much damage and don't have their cursed energy features negated. They can repeat the saving throw at the beginning of their turns, ending the effect on a success.</p>",
